<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 2.6 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 2.6 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 2.6 percent in October, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   Oct 96     Year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +2.6	 +0.2</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +2.8	 +1.7</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +2.8	 -1.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
